# EmulationStation runs inside a fullscreen xterm so runcommand / RetroPie menus
xrdb -merge $HOME/.Xresources   # theme colours for xterm / text menus
# have a real foreground terminal (otherwise they get SIGTTIN-stopped -> black screen).
# Quit ES twice within 5s to drop to Openbox.
python3 /usr/local/bin/retropie-music daemon &   # Super RetroPie menu music
# game loading screens: started once so a game's screen shows the instant it is picked (EmulationStation
# game-start script); restarted if it ever stops
(while true; do python3 /usr/local/bin/retropie-launchscreen --daemon >/dev/null 2>&1; sleep 2; done) &
sunshine &   # game streaming to other screens (Moonlight)
while true; do
    # retropie-scrape holds ES while it rebuilds the game lists
    while [ -e /tmp/es-hold ]; do sleep 1; done
    python3 /usr/local/bin/retropie-loading &   # Super RetroPie loading screen until ES has loaded
    start=$(date +%s)
    xterm -fullscreen -bg black -fg white -fa 'DejaVu Sans Mono' -fs 16 \
        -e /usr/bin/emulationstation --no-splash
    [ $(( $(date +%s) - start )) -lt 5 ] && break
done &
